## Gates

- Gate A: Any dev can run full stack locally in under 20 minutes.
- Gate B: Org-scoped auth and licensing controls work end-to-end.
- Gate C: Single and batch parsing works with no raw-log retention.
- Gate D: Core visualizations and formatted log viewer are production-usable.
- Gate E: Security and privacy controls are validated for beta.
- Gate F: Reliability and product quality meet GA standards.

